1. FREE USE

You may use, copy, run and modify the Software free of charge for any of the
following:

  (a) Own-flock use. An individual herder or a family farm may use the Software
      to manage livestock that they own or raise themselves, including animals
      raised for sale.

  (b) Learning and evaluation. Studying the code, teaching, research, testing,
      and trying the Software out to decide whether to ask for a commercial
      licence.

  (c) Contributing. Preparing fixes and improvements to offer back to this
      repository.


